# The repo ignores *.png; the card build needs these logo and input files, so they are committed.
!brand-kits/media/*.png
!wow/inputs/*.png
# The repo ignores *.py; the card build script and kit validator are part of the card.
!site/build.py
!brand-kits/validate.py
# The hosted card serves its logo PNG from site/media.
!site/media/*.png
.test-tmp/
